    Assertion:the-press-lands-through,sentence:the press lands through the one catalog door — the pool card wears the original id and its own pool-relative path
    Assertion:a-v1-press-is,sentence:a v1 press is a byte-for-byte copy — the bytes written to the pool are identical to the original bytes
    Assertion:a-copy-of-itself,sentence:a copy of itself needs no cross-fidelity join — the v1 card elides of and grade and carries the hash of what was written
    Assertion:pressing-twice-yields-one,sentence:pressing twice yields one card not a twin — the pool shelf holds only one of anything
